    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is infinite. Can you even trust yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/14292e59a75ae6b7dcc4a2aae11b9705.poster.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/14292e59a75ae6b7dcc4a2aae11b9705.webm?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/14292e59a75ae6b7dcc4a2aae11b9705.mp4?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/becee22f34ee4ca451b7240f29a1464f.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: you wake up on a drifting space station, completely isolated in the endless void. The systems are barely holding on, and your only companion is the irresistibly intriguing Cassiopeia. Together, you\u2019re forced to keep the station running, but there\u2019s a catch\u2014one of you isn\u2019t human. And it might just be... you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/72c112e763b0ed242256e94b884252cf.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the broken-down space station, dig into its mysteries, and uncover the truth about yourself and your enigmatic partner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/759d7dd199228279b53ed404210f4f97.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation, tension, and doubt turn into an electrifying connection. Will you work through your suspicions, or will desire pull you into a whirlwind of passion and uncertainty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/a7e9deb85353c03ebc6f61e8966d3fbf.poster.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/a7e9deb85353c03ebc6f61e8966d3fbf.webm?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/a7e9deb85353c03ebc6f61e8966d3fbf.mp4?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83e\udd16 Trust no one. Not even yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station\u2019s AI hints at sabotage. There\u2019s an android among you. The closer you get to Cassiopeia, the more you wonder: is she really what she seems to be? Or are you the one living a lie? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Is space your prison?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station, the malfunctions, even your own memories\u2014what if they\u2019re all part of some twisted experiment? Who\u2019s the real enemy? The void? The android? Or maybe... it\u2019s you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/7808a7a3b8697c1e72f6b498f1296e85.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 A captivating story that blends sci-fi, eroticism, and psychological tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Intense adult content with romantic and steamy moments that deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Emotional choices and dilemmas that challenge your perception of trust, identity, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf20 Stunning visuals and immersive soundscapes that pull you into the vast emptiness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/3e5bea92ad7f73628bdbf4ba7995ba7e.poster.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/3e5bea92ad7f73628bdbf4ba7995ba7e.webm?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/3e5bea92ad7f73628bdbf4ba7995ba7e.mp4?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Can you uncover the truth before the station becomes your tomb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to face infinity?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space is infinite. Can you even trust yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/14292e59a75ae6b7dcc4a2aae11b9705.poster.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/14292e59a75ae6b7dcc4a2aae11b9705.webm?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/14292e59a75ae6b7dcc4a2aae11b9705.mp4?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/becee22f34ee4ca451b7240f29a1464f.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: you wake up on a drifting space station, completely isolated in the endless void. The systems are barely holding on, and your only companion is the irresistibly intriguing Cassiopeia. Together, you\u2019re forced to keep the station running, but there\u2019s a catch\u2014one of you isn\u2019t human. And it might just be... you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/72c112e763b0ed242256e94b884252cf.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the broken-down space station, dig into its mysteries, and uncover the truth about yourself and your enigmatic partner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/759d7dd199228279b53ed404210f4f97.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isolation, tension, and doubt turn into an electrifying connection. Will you work through your suspicions, or will desire pull you into a whirlwind of passion and uncertainty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/a7e9deb85353c03ebc6f61e8966d3fbf.poster.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/a7e9deb85353c03ebc6f61e8966d3fbf.webm?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/a7e9deb85353c03ebc6f61e8966d3fbf.mp4?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83e\udd16 Trust no one. Not even yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station\u2019s AI hints at sabotage. There\u2019s an android among you. The closer you get to Cassiopeia, the more you wonder: is she really what she seems to be? Or are you the one living a lie? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Is space your prison?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The station, the malfunctions, even your own memories\u2014what if they\u2019re all part of some twisted experiment? Who\u2019s the real enemy? The void? The android? Or maybe... it\u2019s you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/7808a7a3b8697c1e72f6b498f1296e85.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=86 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 A captivating story that blends sci-fi, eroticism, and psychological tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Intense adult content with romantic and steamy moments that deepen the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Emotional choices and dilemmas that challenge your perception of trust, identity, and connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf20 Stunning visuals and immersive soundscapes that pull you into the vast emptiness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/3e5bea92ad7f73628bdbf4ba7995ba7e.poster.avif?t=1755538663\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/3e5bea92ad7f73628bdbf4ba7995ba7e.webm?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472100/extras/3e5bea92ad7f73628bdbf4ba7995ba7e.mp4?t=1755538663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Can you uncover the truth before the station becomes your tomb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to face infinity?</p>",
